
 ✗  No API token found

    pt authenticates with an API token from a .pipetower file (JSON) with one or more environments.

    Looked in $PIPETOWER_URL / $PIPETOWER_TOKEN and:
      ~/.pipetower
      /nonexistent/.pipetower
      /.pipetower

    Create a token   <your Pipetower URL>/account  →  API tokens
    Save it          echo '{"environment": "prod", "environments": {"prod": {"url": "https://app.pipetower.com", "token": "<token>"}}}' > ~/.pipetower
    Protect it       chmod 600 ~/.pipetower

